@@ -559,6 +585,49 @@ MtPyre_Summit_Text_WillYouHearOutMyTale:
 	.string "Will you hear out my tale? A tale long\n"
 	.string "told in the HOENN region?$"
 
+MtPyre_Summit_Text_GuardiansLegend:
+	.string "These two orbs have protected HOENN\n"
+	.string "for generations…\p"
+	.string "But there are older legends, from\n"
+	.string "before even these two treasures were\l"
+	.string "known.\p"
+	.string "Two guardians, they say. One watches\n"
+	.string "over the skies. One watches over the\l"
+	.string "oceans.\p"
+	.string "Where the land, the sea, and the sky\n"
+	.string "meet, the old people kept their\l"
+	.string "vigil.$"
+
+MtPyre_Summit_Text_GuardiansInscription:
+	.string "There is an old stone here on the\n"
+	.string "summit. You walked past it, I think.\p"
+	.string "Read it now, with the orbs returned\n"
+	.string "to their place. Perhaps it will read\l"
+	.string "you back.$"
+
+MtPyre_Summit_Text_GuardiansReminder:
+	.string "The old stone waits on this summit,\n"
+	.string "and the guardians wait beyond the\l"
+	.string "sea.\p"
+	.string "An old sailor in LILYCOVE keeps the\n"
+	.string "maritime records. Show him what you\l"
+	.string "have read here.$"
+
+MtPyre_Summit_Text_InscriptionWorn:
+	.string "It's an ancient stone slab.\n"
+	.string "Its carvings have been worn smooth\l"
+	.string "by wind and rain.$"
+
+MtPyre_Summit_Text_InscriptionAncient:
+	.string "The carvings seem to deepen as you\n"
+	.string "trace them…\p"
+	.string "“WHEN THE SKY AND THE SEA ARE\n"
+	.string "HELD IN BALANCE, THE PATH TO THE\l"
+	.string "SACRED ISLE SHALL OPEN.”\p"
+	.string "Two shapes are carved below: one\n"
+	.string "winged and radiant, one long and\n"
+	.string "coiled like the current.$"
+
 MtPyre_Summit_Text_GroudonKyogreTale:
